+        <dt pn="section-3-3.1">AUTHENTICATION/SECURITY MECHANISM (AUTH)</dt>
+        <dd pn="section-3-3.2">
+          <t indent="0" pn="section-3-3.2.1">The argument field is a Telnet string identifying a supported
